        <UserObject id="design-note" label="ASSESSMENT CONTROLS&#10;Refresh sources before selection. Verify selected versions at worker start.&#10;Failed verification or changed versions stops the assessment.&#10;Use one bounded agent. Keep 24 model calls and a 600-second deadline.&#10;Store exact evidence versions. Save human review decisions separately.&#10;No crawler. No independent reviewer role." tooltip="ASSESSMENT CONTROLS&#10;Refresh sources before selection. Verify selected versions at worker start.&#10;Failed verification or changed versions stops the assessment.&#10;Use one bounded agent. Keep 24 model calls and a 600-second deadline.&#10;Store exact evidence versions. Save human review decisions separately.&#10;No crawler. No independent reviewer role.">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#142537;fontSize=14;">
            <mxGeometry x="40" y="840" width="670" height="220" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject id="boundary-note" label="DESIGN LIMITS&#10;All names identify planned roles. No deployed resource names exist.&#10;TLS: Transport Layer Security. PKCE protects the sign-in code exchange.&#10;IAM: AWS Identity and Access Management. API: application interface.&#10;HTTPS/443 is intended transport. Live connections remain unverified.&#10;Zones show responsibility and trust. They do not specify VPCs or subnets.&#10;AWS SAM defines deployment. Local adapters use the same application logic." tooltip="DESIGN LIMITS&#10;All names identify planned roles. No deployed resource names exist.&#10;TLS: Transport Layer Security. PKCE protects the sign-in code exchange.&#10;IAM: AWS Identity and Access Management. API: application interface.&#10;HTTPS/443 is intended transport. Live connections remain unverified.&#10;Zones show responsibility and trust. They do not specify VPCs or subnets.&#10;AWS SAM defines deployment. Local adapters use the same application logic.">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#142537;fontSize=14;">
            <mxGeometry x="1230" y="840" width="650" height="235" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject id="model-note" label="Profile: in.openai.gpt-5.6-luna&#10;Allow Mumbai and Hyderabad only.&#10;Verify destinations, access, and quality&#10;before private uploads." tooltip="Profile: in.openai.gpt-5.6-luna&#10;Allow Mumbai and Hyderabad only.&#10;Verify destinations, access, and quality&#10;before private uploads.">
